# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal engineering notes — not published.
#
# AGENT.md files throughout this theme carry the detailed design reasoning:
# why each subsystem is shaped the way it is, the bugs that shaped it, and
# the traps to avoid when changing it. They are written for whoever works
# on this next, not for people installing it, and some of it describes
# internal process rather than the code.
#
# NOTE: excluding them means they are not version-controlled and not backed
# up anywhere. If that matters, mirror them to a private repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
AGENT.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test tooling.
#
# PHPUnit and its dependencies live in tests/ with their own composer.json,
# deliberately separate from the theme root's vendor/ — which IS committed,
# because a fresh clone must work with no composer install at all. Keeping
# dev-only packages out of that vendor/ is what makes committing it safe.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
tests/vendor/
.phpunit.result.cache

# Machine-specific: contains a local database socket path.
tests/wp-tests-config.php

# Build output
*.zip

# OS and editor cruft
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
